## Conclusion

The Tiny Virtual Machine project demonstrates the basic working principles of a virtual machine using the C programming language.

It provides a practical understanding of instruction loading, decoding, execution, variable management, stack operations, and control flow.

This project helped us understand how intermediate instructions can be interpreted and executed by a simple virtual machine.

